# Asymmetry root-cause audit (`ns_cfd/asymmetry_audit.py`)

Steady P2/P1 Newton (imperfection continuation 0.3 → 0 unless noted). Re_peak = ρ u_max H / μ, H = 5 mm. Centreline asym = max|v| on y = 0 / u_max. Branch: asymmetric if the node-wise symmetry error ≥ 1e-6. Laptop CPU, one thread.

## Mesh mirror symmetry

`crossed` 250x40 at 65%: 20291/20291 nodes mirrored (max deviation 4.3e-19 m), 40000/40000 triangles, 580/580 tagged boundary facets.

